{"3339570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adrenaline Overdrive", "steam_appid": 3339570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate 1980s where North Korea won their war, Brooklyn lies in ruins. The streets are controlled by the Vires syndicate, operating under the façade of Vires Corporations. As a former detective whose brother was murdered while investigating Vires Corporations, you've made a fatal choice: injecting yourself with <strong>SPIKE</strong>, a deadly military-grade stimulant that grants superhuman abilities at the cost of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/24244b975fc55758b9c60d801ad3c2cb.poster.avif?t=1784714026\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/24244b975fc55758b9c60d801ad3c2cb.webm?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/24244b975fc55758b9c60d801ad3c2cb.mp4?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• MASTER SUPERNATURAL MOVEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and slide  as you tear through urban battlegrounds. Your enhanced abilities make you unstoppable - if you can stay alive long enough to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• EXPLORE A FRACTURED CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit corporate towers to abandoned subway tunnels, every corner of this alternate Brooklyn tells a story of war, corruption, and resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/87dc9793b039a66b3e83799cfc59c84a.poster.avif?t=1784714026\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/87dc9793b039a66b3e83799cfc59c84a.webm?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/87dc9793b039a66b3e83799cfc59c84a.mp4?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNLEASH YOUR ARSENAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an array of classic and experimental weapons, or use your bare fists to pummel your way through thug after thug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNCOVER THE TRUTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With guidance from a mysterious pyramid-shaped entity, dive deep into a conspiracy that blurs the lines between victim and villain, justice and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/e4d271fcd986f7f38d87a9815e092ad4.poster.avif?t=1784714026\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/e4d271fcd986f7f38d87a9815e092ad4.webm?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/e4d271fcd986f7f38d87a9815e092ad4.mp4?t=1784714026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• WISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see here, please feel free to WISHLIST now, Thanks so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragrap